    <h2>ADR-0007a resolutions — the three glyphs no font in the stack has</h2>
    <p class="lede" style="font-size: 13.5px;">
      <code>●</code>
      <code>○</code>
      <code>◐</code> are absent from every font file (see docs/reference/glyph-coverage.md).
      These are the drawn substitutes, next to real body text, so a mismatch in size or alignment
      is visible before any real component depends on them.
    </p>
